<title>SWITZERLAND: Ems sees higher 1997 sales, op profit.</title>
<headline>Ems sees higher 1997 sales, op profit.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss chemical company EMS Group said it expected sales and operating profits to continue rising in 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;EMS expects a further increase in turnover in 1997,&quot; the group said in a statement on its 1996 results.</p>
<p>&quot;Provided the currency situation does not significantly deteriorate then operating income should also continue to improve,&quot; EMS said.</p>
</text>
